# Optional overrides for `k dev` in paybox/. Nothing here is needed: `k dev`
# uses SQLite in .k/ (DATABASE_URL defaults to sqlite:.k/paybox.db), and at
# the workspace root it wires K_SERVICE_TOKEN itself; run alone, paybox
# generates one into .k/secrets/K_SERVICE_TOKEN (k.toml's [dev.secrets]).
# Copy to .env (git-ignored) only to change something.
# See docs/design/25-config-and-secrets.md.

# A Postgres database instead of SQLite:
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://paybox@localhost:5432/paybox
# DATABASE_PASSWORD_FILE=../secrets/paybox_db_password.txt
